# Canonical Turtle for the protocol-derived encoding of:
#   Viren Tyagi et al. (2025). Tracing Ion Migration in Halide Perovskites with Machine Learned Force Fields.
#   The Journal of Physical Chemistry Letters. doi:10.1021/acs.jpclett.5c01139  arXiv:2409.16051v2
#
# Version read: arxiv-preprint arXiv:2409.16051v2 (sha256 6c1e92d7a372e50c...);
#   the DOI above is cited, numbers are those of the version read.
# Corpus rank 360 (Application/model instance). Method identity follows
#   artifacts/kg/METHODS.md (registry: artifacts/kg/methods-registry.csv).
# Generated by artifacts/scripts/encode_paper.py from artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/tyagi2025.yaml.
#
# Encoding scope: six VASP on-the-fly MLFFs (Bayesian on-the-fly
# sampling from short AIMD at 600-750 K in 2x2x2 CsPbI3 supercells with
# one iodide defect), one per defect charge state, trained on PBE-D3(BJ)
# energies, forces and stresses, and used in 2 ns MD of 6x6x6 supercells
# at 500-600 K. The force errors on 6x6x6 MD snapshots are given only as
# an upper bound over all six models (gaps); migration barriers,
# diffusion coefficients and activation energies are properties.

@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix schema: <https://schema.org/> .
@prefix mls: <http://www.w3.org/ns/mls#> .
@prefix unit: <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/> .
@prefix mlips: <https://w3id.org/mlips#> .
@prefix entity: <https://w3id.org/mlips/entity/> .

###############################################################################
# Q1 -- Bibliographic identification
###############################################################################

entity:study-tyagi2025 a mlips:BenchmarkStudy ;
    rdfs:label "Tyagi et al. (2025): on-the-fly VASP MLFFs for charged iodide interstitials and vacancies in CsPbI3 and their migration" ;
    mlips:reportedIn entity:article-tyagi2025 .

