###############################################################################
# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - Force errors on 600 K snapshots of 6x6x6 supercells are given only as bounds over all six MLFFs (MAE at most 54.83 meV/A, R2 above 0.94; near the defect at most 61.88 meV/A), so no per-model values are encoded; details are in SI Note 6.
# - MLFF vs DFT migration barriers (differences of about 0.1 eV, 0.22 eV for V_I^0; Fig. 1), diffusion coefficients and activation energies (Table 1) are properties.
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: crossref).
# - Evaluation roles and data, base models, inference timings with their system sizes, and the source location of each value are recorded in the encoding input (artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/tyagi2025.yaml) until the schema has terms for them.
